docs/mirrors/

# Rust
target/

# Clauded planning docs
docs/

# Reverse-engineering material: the behavioural spec, the content database,
# the oracle transcripts and the gang house files. Derived from the game's own
# binaries and data, and not ours to redistribute. Kept on disk, never tracked.
re/
__pycache__/

# Runtime state written by mud-server.
state.sqlite
state.sqlite-journal
state.sqlite-wal

# Stray live-board captures dropped in the working directory: their TX
# stream carries the account password, so they must never be committed.
# Root-scoped on purpose. The curated RX-only corpus in re/oracle/ is
# added by hand and stays tracked.
/*.raw
/*_timing.log
